(7238615, 1120704, 52928, '<td valign="top">I like the composition but would like to have seen a little more light on her face from a reflector, say.</td>', 'I like the composition but would like to have seen a little more light on her face from a reflector, say.', '2014-07-08 12:20:33.000000', NULL, 1),
