(7238716, 1120638, 43463, '<td valign="top">Voted earlier coming back to comment.<br/> <br/>Great tones, warm colors, and action of the person walking the tree lined path. Love the silhouette of the tall trees - the tall thin upright shapes are akin and complements that of the man that walks amoung them. I like the feel of this as the warm tones give a feel of a warm summer day as we walk along with the person following the path home.</td>', 'Voted earlier coming back to comment. Great tones, warm colors, and action of the person walking the tree lined path. Love the silhouette of the tall trees - the tall thin upright shapes are akin and complements that of the man that walks amoung them. I like the feel of this as the warm tones give a feel of a warm summer day as we walk along with the person following the path home.', '2014-07-08 14:20:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(7238717, 1120975, 43463, '<td valign="top">Voted earlier coming back to comment.<br/> <br/>Love the soft light that streams through the window to illuminate the bowl of fruit sitting on the table. One also get snippets of what else lies inside the home.</td>', 'Voted earlier coming back to comment. Love the soft light that streams through the window to illuminate the bowl of fruit sitting on the table. One also get snippets of what else lies inside the home.', '2014-07-08 14:21:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(7238724, 1120604, 43463, '<td valign="top">Voted earlier coming back to comment.<br/> <br/>Love the light here that illuminates the two deer. B&amp;W tones are fantastic and well done. I like the title for the two are are facing in the opposite direction - a yin and yang.</td>', 'Voted earlier coming back to comment. Love the light here that illuminates the two deer. B&W tones are fantastic and well done. I like the title for the two are are facing in the opposite direction - a yin and yang.', '2014-07-08 14:29:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(7238785, 1120193, 58634, '<td valign="top">Lots of beauty portrayed here.</td>', 'Lots of beauty portrayed here.', '2014-07-08 15:50:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(7238787, 1120719, 58634, '<td valign="top">Beautiful use of contre-jour. I tried doing something like this a few challenges ago but wasn''t able to accomplish it. Good job.</td>', 'Beautiful use of contre-jour. I tried doing something like this a few challenges ago but wasn''t able to accomplish it. Good job.', '2014-07-08 15:52:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(7238843, 1120012, 43463, '<td valign="top">Voted earlier coming back to comment.<br/> <br/>Nice light that lights the scene. Love the quiet understanding between the cowboy and his horse - they are indeed partners. Very nicely captured.</td>', 'Voted earlier coming back to comment. Nice light that lights the scene. Love the quiet understanding between the cowboy and his horse - they are indeed partners. Very nicely captured.', '2014-07-08 19:01:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(7238844, 1120862, 43463, '<td valign="top">Voted earlier coming back to comment.<br/> <br/>Fantastic capture! I love how they are flying away from the sun. Not only is the arc acting as a ring around the sun but it serves to encapsule/frame the flight of these two birds.</td>', 'Voted earlier coming back to comment. Fantastic capture! I love how they are flying away from the sun. Not only is the arc acting as a ring around the sun but it serves to encapsule/frame the flight of these two birds.', '2014-07-08 19:04:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(7238848, 1120861, 43463, '<td valign="top">Voted earlier coming back to comment.<br/> <br/>Nice moment between the two people (father and son is a guess). The eldest is pointing out something to the youngest. It is a moment of learning and discovery. I think the photo could be even stronger if you cropped closer so that you eliminate most of the distracting glare on the rocks and bring your audience closer to the people who are the main subject of the shot.</td>', 'Voted earlier coming back to comment. Nice moment between the two people (father and son is a guess). The eldest is pointing out something to the youngest. It is a moment of learning and discovery. I think the photo could be even stronger if you cropped closer so that you eliminate most of the distracting glare on the rocks and bring your audience closer to the people who are the main subject of the shot.', '2014-07-08 19:08:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(7238850, 1120937, 43463, '<td valign="top">Voted earlier coming back to comment.<br/> <br/>Very nice colors and a zen like mood with the meditating person in the shot. I think that this photo could be even stronger in visual if it was cropped/framed on the vertical. It would then complement the straight line of the person and keep the eye centered on the two main subjects of the shot - the sun and the meditator. As it is now I think there is too much empty space off on either side that do very little for the visual impact of the shot.</td>', 'Voted earlier coming back to comment. Very nice colors and a zen like mood with the meditating person in the shot. I think that this photo could be even stronger in visual if it was cropped/framed on the vertical. It would then complement the straight line of the person and keep the eye centered on the two main subjects of the shot - the sun and the meditator. As it is now I think there is too much empty space off on either side that do very little for the visual impact of the shot.', '2014-07-08 19:11:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(7238864, 1120695, 58634, '<td valign="top">It''s like looking into the emptiness. I can get lost here.</td>', 'It''s like looking into the emptiness. I can get lost here.', '2014-07-08 20:14:08.000000', NULL, 1),
